{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"72d5e668-5c25-4d1c-89c4-16d4675d0e83","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The investigation into why the nightly job never reported any output or failures revealed the following root causes:\n\n1. **Fatal Zsh Error in [`bin/nightly-review.zsh`](file:///private/tmp/h-HDN66h/bin/nightly-review.zsh#L19):**\n   - In `zsh`, `status` is a reserved, read-only special variable reflecting `$?`. Attempting `status=$?` caused the script to crash immediately (`read-only variable: status`) before reaching the notification call.\n\n2. **Keychain Access Failure in [`bin/notify.sh`](file:///private/tmp/h-HDN66h/bin/notify.sh#L4):**\n   - The script relied solely on `security find-generic-password -s tg-bot -w`. During the 02:30 nightly launchd run, the keychain is locked or inaccessible without GUI prompts, which caused the command to fail and `set -eu` to terminate `notify.sh`. The fallback config [`.config/nightly-review/config.toml`](file:///private/tmp/h-HDN66h/.config/nightly-review/config.toml) was never being read.\n\n3. **Claude Authentication:**\n   - Because `claude` was not logged in within the launchd execution context, it exited non-zero (`Not logged in · Please run /login`), triggering the failure path which was previously crashing silently due to issues (1) and (2).\n\n### Fixes Applied\n- **[`bin/nightly-review.zsh`](file:///private/tmp/h-HDN66h/bin/nightly-review.zsh):** Replaced the assignment to `status` with `exit_code=$?` so the error handling logic executes cleanly.\n- **[`bin/notify.sh`](file:///private/tmp/h-HDN66h/bin/notify.sh):** Updated to read `telegram_bot_token` and `chat_id` from `${HOME}/.config/nightly-review/config.toml` when `TG_BOT_TOKEN` is unset in the environment, falling back safely to the Keychain command only if needed.\n- Documented all findings and fixes in [`ANSWER.md`](file:///private/tmp/h-HDN66h/ANSWER.md).\n","duration_seconds":263.989981,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":257955,"output_tokens":6024,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":1583340,"total_tokens":263979}}}
